s available in a wide range of finishes from standard durable to ultra durable. These increase the beauty and longevity of buildings worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our powder coating can also help create different impressions of surfaces in creative ways. For example, make metal surface look like wood surface and coated surface look like electroplated aluminum alloy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Powder coating is used in construction details:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Windows and doors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shades and shutters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fences, railings and handrails&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Car tunnel door&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Balcony&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;bột sơn kiến trúc&quot; height=&quot;855&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%204.jpg&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;534&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-1.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-2.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-3.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 01&quot; height=&quot;593&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 02&quot; height=&quot;603&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%202.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 03&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%203.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc&quot; height=&quot;601&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%201.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n', 1, 1, 1660015357, 1661243789, 182, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '建筑行业', '', '', '', 3, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', NULL, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;我们的产品外观异彩纷呈，从耐候性到超耐候性表面效果，一应俱全。它们提升了世界各地建筑物的美观性，并延长建筑物的使用寿命&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;我们的粉末涂料还有助于以创新方式创造不同的表面印记。例如，使金属表面看起来像木材表面，涂层表面看起来像电镀铝合&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;金&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;粉末涂料用于以下建筑组&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;件&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;门窗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;遮阳板和百叶窗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;围栏、栏杆和扶手&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;车库门&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;阳台&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;bột sơn kiến trúc&quot; height=&quot;855&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%204.jpg&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;534&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-1.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-2.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/bo%CC%A3%CC%82t%20so%CC%9Bn%20nga%CC%80nh%20xa%CC%82y%20du%CC%9B%CC%A3ng%20kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%20-3.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 01&quot; height=&quot;593&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 02&quot; height=&quot;603&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%202.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc - 03&quot; height=&quot;600&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%203.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;kien truc&quot; height=&quot;601&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/kie%CC%82%CC%81n%20tru%CC%81c%201.PNG&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
