t;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n', 'Household furniture', '', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Powder coating must conform to rigorous performance criteria for interior products. Quang Min Powder Paint with outstanding scratch resistance, anti-corrosion, anti-ultraviolet protection helps protect interior products absolutely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;Powder coating must conform to rigorous performance criteria for interior products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;For extended life, it is important to protect furniture with high scratch resistance, friction resistance, UV resistance and anti-corrosion coating.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;789&quot; src=&quot;https://botsonquangmin.com/upload/images/hinh%20anh%20noi%20that%20-%2001.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;Interpon powder coating is used on the following furniture products:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;Metal tables and chairs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&