ckground 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer-inner&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 25px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-0abcfd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;0abcfd2&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Plant bee-friendly plants&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-c96f55e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;c96f55e&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.3px; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; margin: 10px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;It takes around four to seven years for a macadamia tree to start producing nuts, but during that time you can be busy planting some other flowering plants. Macadamias are pollinated by insect activity, so surrounding your macadamia tree with insect-attracting plants will help it produce more nuts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-cc69cb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;cc69cb0&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;spacer.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer-inner&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 1vh;&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-936b72f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;936b72f&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Check for pests and diseases&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-69b52a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;69b52a8&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.3px; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; margin: 10px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;For an abundant harvest of mouth-watering macadamias, it’s important to protect your nuts from creatures big and small that love feasting on the delicious kernels as much as we do. Trees generally grow too big to net, so keep birds like cockatoos and galahs at bay by using scare tactics. Hanging noise-making or shiny items (like old CDs) in the tree can work well. Rats might need professional baiting, unless you want to get a dog or cat to do the control job for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;Nut borer is a smaller, but no less devastating, pest that can affect your harvest. Unfortunately, pyrethrum sprays won’t work on these critters that lay eggs in the maturing nuts. One natural solution is to introduce trichogramma wasps which parasitise nut borer eggs. They are available to purchase in the mail as well as a range of other beneficial insects. Another natural solution can be to remove all the nuts for a season in order to take away the borers laying sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'Tips for successful growing', '', '&lt;p&gt;Macadamias are native to Australia and are hardy trees when planted in the right location with suitable growing conditions. To have the best chance of success with your tree, try the following suggestions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-73e1a7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;73e1a7e&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4em; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Follow these guidelines to keep your backyard macadamia thriving and productive.&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-cdffe1f elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;cdffe1f&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;spacer.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer-inner&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 25px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-88c64bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;88c64bc&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4em; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Choose the right variety of macadamia&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-c737530 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;c737530&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.3px; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; margin: 10px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;There are four varieties of macadamia to choose from so speak to your nursery about which one will grow best in your location. If you want to enjoy your own home grown nuts sooner, we recommend purchasing an established macadamia sapling from an Australian natives nursery. These have often been grafted onto root stock that is more disease resistant and will give your backyard tree the best chance of success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-37255fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-image&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;37255fa&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;image.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; text-align: center; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-image&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;attachment-large size-large&quot; height=&quot;534&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px&quot; src=&quot;https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-1024x683.jpg&quot; srcset=&quot;https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://www.australian-macadamias.org/app/uploads/2021/09/0421-Lewis-Bundaberg-24-2048x1365.jpg 2048w&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: none; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 0px; box-shadow: none; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; width: 961px;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-13b8620 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;13b8620&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;spacer.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer-inner&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 25px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-0abcfd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;0abcfd2&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Plant bee-friendly plants&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-c96f55e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;c96f55e&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.3px; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; margin: 10px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;It takes around four to seven years for a macadamia tree to start producing nuts, but during that time you can be busy planting some other flowering plants. Macadamias are pollinated by insect activity, so surrounding your macadamia tree with insect-attracting plants will help it produce more nuts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-cc69cb0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;cc69cb0&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;spacer.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-spacer-inner&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 1vh;&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-936b72f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;936b72f&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;heading.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(122, 122, 122); font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: &amp;quot;Eagle Book&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-size: 27px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;Check for pests and diseases&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-69b52a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-id=&quot;69b52a8&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;text-editor.default&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; font-family: &amp;quot;Avenir 55&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9em; letter-spacing: 0.3px; width: 961px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.81);&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s; margin: 10px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;For an abundant harvest of mouth-watering macadamias, it’s important to protect your nuts from creatures big and small that love feasting on the delicious kernels as much as we do. Trees generally grow too big to net, so keep birds like cockatoos and galahs at bay by using scare tactics. Hanging noise-making or shiny items (like old CDs) in the tree can work well. Rats might need professional baiting, unless you want to get a dog or cat to do the control job for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;Nut borer is a smaller, but no less devastating, pest that can affect your harvest. Unfortunately, pyrethrum sprays won’t work on these critters that lay eggs in the maturing nuts. One natural solution is to introduce trichogramma wasps which parasitise nut borer eggs. They are available to purchase in the mail as well as a range of other beneficial insects. Another natural solution can be to remove all the nuts for a season in order to take away the borers laying sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 1, 1, 1666879782, 1677439256, 38, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 3, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', NULL, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
