(20, 0, NULL, 'tin-tuc', 'GROWING', 'GROWING', '&lt;p&gt;The moreish taste of macadamias means that they are gobbled up easily and don’t last long in the cupboard! This leads many people to consider growing their own supply of delicious nuts. The good news is that it is possible to produce your own supply of nuts at home. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Macadamia trees aren’t just a great plant to have in the garden if you love the nuts. They are also a very attractive tree, especially during spring, when they burst into bloom, producing beautiful strands of tiny white and pale pink flowers called racemes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '', '', '', '', 'tin-trong-nuoc', 'country-news', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'maccaicon-4994.png', 'maccaicon-5650_383x374.png', 2, 1, 1666599012, 1677438637, 0, '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, '', '', '');
