s-serif; letter-spacing: var(--font-main-letterspacing); display: flex;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lte-icon-content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: -5px 0px 0px 25px; margin-inline: 25px 0px; display: flex; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lte-header&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--font-headers), serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: var(--font-headers-letterspacing); overflow-wrap: break-word; transition: all 0.2s ease 0s; display: block; margin: 0px; color: var(--black);&quot;&gt; &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; src=&quot;http://localhost/web-cafefin/upload/images/phone-head.png&quot; width=&quot;24&quot; /&gt; 3-068-387-01-39&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', '&lt;div class=\\&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-513d6b3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\\&quot; data-element_type=\\&quot;widget\\&quot; data-id=\\&quot;513d6b3\\&quot; data-widget_type=\\&quot;text-editor.default\\&quot; style=\\&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7em; font-family: Jost, sans-serif; position: relative; width: 630px; margin-bottom: 0px; max-width: 630px; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=\\&quot;elementor-widget-container\\&quot; style=\\&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.7em; font-family: var(--font-main), sans-serif; letter-spacing: var(--font-main-letterspacing); transition: background 0.3s ease 0s, border 0.3s ease 0s, border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-border-radius 0.3s ease 0s, -webkit-box-shadow 0.3s ease 0s;\\&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=\\&quot;elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\\&quot; style=\\&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.7em; font-family: var(--font-main), sans-serif; letter-spacing: var(--font-main-letterspacing);\\&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 2.2em 0px 0.9em; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Catamaran, serif; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); transition: color 0.2s ease-in-out 0s; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;OUR STORY… IN A NUTSHELL&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;Fourteen years ago, in the heart of Brisbane’s fashionable James St. precinct, we had a kernel of an idea to fill people’s pantries with the highest quality Australian, local and imported wholefood ingredients.  Now all these years later our boutique family owned and operated business The Nut Market, has ripened and become an ingrained part of the local foodie community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=\\&quot;\\&quot; src=\\&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2185/7175/files/The_Nut_Market_James_Street_12_of_29.jpg?v=1591249441\\&quot; style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-style: none; vertical-align: top; display: block; margin: 3em auto;\\&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;Implanted at the core of our business is a passion for our family and our land. Our abundant home state of Queensland has the highest proportion of land area in Australia, some 84%, dedicated to agriculture. Not only are we nuts about supporting our local crop growers and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;producers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; but also about bringing their unique, high quality products to you in both a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;sustainable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; and accessible way. Like so many young families we believe the physical health of our children and the health of their future on our planet needs to be one and the same. The question we asked ourselves as a business was; without sacrificing on the quality of our product how do we help our customers balance the demands of their busy lives and be eco warriors too? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=\\&quot;The Nut Market on James Street in New Fram, Brisbane\\&quot; src=\\&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2185/7175/files/The_Nut_Market_James_Street_29_of_29.jpg?v=1591250210\\&quot; style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-style: none; vertical-align: top; display: block; margin: 3em auto;\\&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;The word convenient doesn’t necessarily have to mean “eco-UNfriendly” when it comes to how you buy and store your food. All of our products are hand-packed daily in-store, inside our custom designed kraft paper resealable bags. That’s guaranteed freshness sealed in! No more stale, unhygienic product that’s been sitting around in bulk bins. Who knows how many people have been fondling your nuts!?! We follow stringent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;food health &amp; safety&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; guidelines to make sure you\\\'re receiving not just quality product, but safely packaged and fresh product too. We’re always foraging for new ways to be friendly on the environment, friendly on your family’s health and friendly on your lifestyle. Because where our appetite for exceptional quality ingredients lives, is where your pantry begins…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 2.2em 0px 0.9em; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Catamaran, serif; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); transition: color 0.2s ease-in-out 0s; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;OUR STORE… IN A NUTSHELL&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;Exceptional products, good prices, sourced locally, supplied fresh to you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;Stepping into our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;James St. store&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; is a little like falling down the peanut hole! A large variety of unique and hard to source ingredients awaits you. Our experienced team of nut enthusiasts are always on hand to guide you through and crack open any questions you may have. We are so passionate about what we do that most days you’ll find us in-store too! Roasting up a warm batch of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;cinnamon nuts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;, grinding up a fresh assortment of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;pure nut butters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; or packaging up another bountiful order to send out to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;likeminded stockists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;. We look forward to snacking with you next time you’re in the neighbourhood. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 2.2em 0px 0.9em; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Catamaran, serif; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); transition: color 0.2s ease-in-out 0s; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;OUR PRODUCT… IN A NUTSHELL&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;Only premium products. Only honest pricing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=\\&quot;\\&quot; src=\\&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2185/7175/files/The_Nut_Market_James_Street_4_of_8.jpg?v=1591658069\\&quot; style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-style: none; vertical-align: top; display: block; margin: 3em auto;\\&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;We stock over 600 lines of the highest-quality, regionally-sourced and imported products, all packaged in time-saving portion sizes and ready to be munched! Peruse our extensive range of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;organic, keto, vegan, dairy free&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;gluten friendly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt; products, before nibbling your way through our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;nuts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;, healthy treats, childhood favorites and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;snack foods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(28, 27, 27); font-family: &amp;quot;Nunito Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: border-box !important;\\&quot;&gt;From locally sourced honey, to activated nuts, exclusive American lines, hot sauces and the finest European chocolates, at The Nut Market you’re sure to find something to please every nutcase in the family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', '', '', '', '240f97089950kx4tpz1olnhjjo0jwlqvubvbgvwm2kgc-9943.jpg', '', 1, 1, 0, 1677460334, '光明涂料有限公司', '&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;光明涂料有限公司成立于2000年，从一个名不见经传的小厂，通过几年拼搏发展成一个集科研、生产、销售为一体的知名企业。我们拥有国际领先水平的粉末生产线，厂房占地面积5000平方米，现有员工200多人。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#B22222;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. 公司简介&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;光明涂料有限公司成立于2000年，从一个名不见经传的小厂，通过几年拼搏发展成一个集科研、生产、销售为一体的知名企业。我们拥有国际领先水平的粉末生产线，厂房占地面积5000平方米，现有员工200多人。 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;2011年在越南注册分公司，地址为：同奈省，边和市，化安坊，安和街道，黄明正路，175/3号&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#B22222;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. 企业宗旨&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;我们靠的是人才与科技，靠的是先进的管理理念，公司始终坚守“你无我有、你有我优”的发展思路，把客户放在一位，专注、专业、专心是我们的企业宗旨，热情、快捷、周到是我们的服务理念。公司坚守“科技领先、质量稳定、信誉至上、发展创新”的经营理念&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#B22222;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. 光明公司的服务和产品&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;我们拥有最具专业知识和丰富经验的管理层、技术研发、销售、客服团队，是一群具有强烈团体意识与合作精神的创新型事业群体。多年来，我们坚持“客户第一”的经营理念；以优质的产品、良好的信誉、真诚的服务为宗旨！依靠科技创新的力量、引进先进的生产设备、积累丰富的业内经验。截止今年，一共与万多家知名企业合作，如乐扣乐扣，澳妥自动门，格兰仕、美的、富士康、LG、惠普、海尔、北京现代、加多宝、本田、壹基金、天地一号等。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;我们有信心为客户提供最优质的粉末产品及最诚信的服务！愿与客户携手共进，合作共赢，共享伟业！&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;光明全体员工宣言：用心做好每件事，真诚对待每个人，光明愿与您共创美好的生活。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;粉末涂料用于以下领域：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;建筑行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;家用家具行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;金属机械行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;陶瓷行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;技术信息行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;汽车电动车行业&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;……&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.1; font-family: UTMAvo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 7px !important; margin-bottom: 7px !important; outline: none !important; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important;&quot;&gt;4.联系我们&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#FF8C00;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;光明涂料有限公司&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;工厂: 同奈省，边和市，化安坊，安和街区，黄明政路，175/3号&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;总部: 同奈省，边和市，化安坊，安和街区，黄明政路，242A号&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;热线: 0972 77 3434 (Zalo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;电话: 0251 368 2963&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;传真: 0251 368 2963&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;税号: 3602557234&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial;&quot;&gt;邮箱: guangming.powder@gmail.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n', '', '', '', '');
