(635, 27, 'baiviet', 'man', 'TRần Hà - Nhân viên tư vấn', 'TRần Hà- Nhân viên tư vấn', 'CÔNG TY TNHH MTV QUANG MIN\r\nĐịa chỉ xưởng: 175/3 Đường Hoàng Minh Chánh, Kp. An Hòa, P. Hóa An, Tp. Biên Hòa, Tỉnh Đồng Nai\r\nHotline: 0972 77 3434 (Zalo)', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien specializes in professional, dedicated, and enthusiastic website design, management and advertising. Cooperated and completed more than 300 large and small website projects in and out of the country. Contact now for advice: 076 868 9440.', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien', 'Nguyen Hoang Tien specializes in professional, dedicated, and enthusiastic website design, management and advertising. Cooperated and completed more than 300 large and small website projects in and out of the country. Contact now for advice: 076 868 9440.', 'tac-gia', ''),
