(1126, 20, 'baiviet', 'man_list', 'HOW TO GROW YOUR OWN MACADAMIAS AT HOME', 'GROWING', 'The moreish taste of macadamias means that they are gobbled up easily and don’t last long in the cupboard! This leads many people to consider growing their own supply of delicious nuts. The good news is that it is possible to produce your own supply of nuts at home. \r\n\r\nMacadamia trees aren’t just a great plant to have in the garden if you love the nuts. They are also a very attractive tree, especially during spring, when they burst into bloom, producing beautiful strands of tiny white and pale pink flowers called racemes.', 'GROWING', 'GROWING', 'GROWING', '', '', '', 'tin-tuc', ''),
(1128, 142, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Growing macadamias from a sapling', 'Growing macadamias from a sapling', 'If you want to enjoy your own home grown nuts as soon as possible, we recommend purchasing an established macadamia sapling from an Australian natives nursery.', 'Growing macadamias from a sapling', '', 'If you want to enjoy your own home grown nuts as soon as possible, we recommend purchasing an established macadamia sapling from an Australian natives nursery.', '', '', '', 'tin-tuc', ''),
(1129, 141, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Tips for successful growing', 'Tips for successful growing', 'Macadamias are native to Australia and are hardy trees when planted in the right location with suitable growing conditions. To have the best chance of success with your tree, try the following suggestions.', 'Tips for successful growing', 'Tips for successful growing', 'Macadamias are native to Australia and are hardy trees when planted in the right location with suitable growing conditions. To have the best chance of success with your tree, try the following suggestions.', '', '', '', 'tin-tuc', ''),
(1131, 154, 'baiviet', 'man', 'History and industry', 'History and industry', 'Macadamias have a long and rich history. Discover the journey they’ve taken from indigenous treasure to global delicacy, and why Australia leads the world in macadamia production', 'History and industry', 'History and industry', 'Macadamias have a long and rich history. Discover the journey they’ve taken from indigenous treasure to global delicacy, and why Australia leads the world in macadamia production', '', '', '', 'tin-tuc', ''),
(1132, 143, 'baiviet', 'man', 'CÔNG DỤNG CỦA BỘT CÀ PHÊ VÀ LƯU Ý', 'CÔNG DỤNG CỦA BỘT CÀ PHÊ VÀ LƯU Ý', 'Cà phê luôn được biết đến như một loại thần dược mà thiên nhiên ban tặng cho con người. Hơn nữa, nước cà phê còn có thể chữa được rất nhiều loại bệnh về tim mạch hay ung thư.', 'GROWING MACADAMIAS FROM SEED', 'GROWING MACADAMIAS FROM SEED', 'The nuts that we love to eat are the seeds that the tree uses to reproduce in nature so it’s actually possible to plant a nut in a shell purchased from the greengrocer in your garden and have it grow into a tree.\r\nAlthough growing a macadamia tree from seed takes time, it is a great project for enthusiastic gardeners and particularly fun for kids to try! Autumn and Spring are both great times to start.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'tin-tuc', ''),
(1134, 121, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Bùi Đình Hiệp', '', 'Bùi Đình Hiệp', 'Henry Bùi', '', 'Henry Bùi', '', '', '', 'tac-gia', ''),
(1135, 0, 'info', 'capnhat', 'Human Proesior', 'Human Proesior', 'Maecenas dapibus mattis eros, at fermentum sapien malesuada sit amet. Quisque in sollicitudin eros. Aliquam eget sapien sed orci accumsan interdum at ac m lorem ut ante pulvinar finibus non non metusi.\r\n\r\n', 'Human Proesior', 'Human Proesior', 'Maecenas dapibus mattis eros, at fermentum sapien malesuada sit amet. Quisque in sollicitudin eros. Aliquam eget sapien sed orci accumsan interdum at ac m lorem ut ante pulvinar finibus non non metusi.\r\n\r\nDownload price\r\n3-068-387-01-39', '', '', '', 'gioi-thieu', ''),
(1138, 148, 'baiviet', 'man', 'DRY ROASTED HAPPY NUT', '', 'Our premium macadamia kernels are delicately dry roasted in shell to ensure an even golden colour with the perfect crunch. Our top-secret drying technology is fuelled by our nut shell bi-products, ensuring our production is environmentally friendly and energy efficient. The macadamia shell is slit over the centre of the nut. A special key is provided inside the pack – just insert the key into the nut shell and twist to reveal a treat unlike any other.\r\n\r\n', 'DRY ROASTED HAPPY NUT', '', 'Our premium macadamia kernels are delicately dry roasted in shell to ensure an even golden colour with the perfect crunch. Our top-secret drying technology is fuelled by our nut shell bi-products, ensuring our production is environmentally friendly and energy efficient. The macadamia shell is slit over the centre of the nut. A special key is provided inside the pack – just insert the key into the nut shell and twist to reveal a treat unlike any other.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'san-pham', ''),
(1139, 149, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Macca Hạnh Phúc - VANI', 'Macca Hạnh Phúc - VANI', 'Sản phẩm macadamia thơm độc đáo này, được làm từ ít nhất 98% nguyên liệu của Úc, được chuẩn bị cẩn thận để đảm bảo cân bằng độ ngọt và giòn trong mỗi mẻ. Vỏ macadamia được rạch ở giữa hạt. Chúng được rang nguyên vỏ trước khi được tẩm hương vani nhẹ nhàng. Một chìa khóa đặc biệt được cung cấp bên trong gói – chỉ cần đút chìa khóa vào vỏ đai ốc và vặn để lộ ra một món quà không giống bất kỳ món nào khác.\r\n\r\n', 'VANILLA HAPPY NUT', '', 'This uniquely aromatic macadamia product, made from at least 98% Australian ingredients, is carefully prepared to ensure the right balance of sweetness and crunch in every batch. The macadamia shell is slit over the centre of the nut. They are roasted in shell before being gently infused with vanilla flavours. A special key is provided inside the pack – just insert the key into the nut shell and twist to reveal a treat unlike any other.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'san-pham', ''),
(1141, 146, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Macca Socola Sữa', '', 'Our Milk Chocolate Macadamias are the ultimate indulgence. Our nuts are drizzled in Belgian milk chocolate until a perfectly even coating is achieved. Topped off with a gloss finish, these really are bite-size pieces of heaven.\r\n\r\n', 'Robusta', 'Robusta', 'Our Milk Chocolate Macadamias are the ultimate indulgence. Our nuts are drizzled in Belgian milk chocolate until a perfectly even coating is achieved. Topped off with a gloss finish, these really are bite-size pieces of heaven.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'san-pham', ''),
(1142, 140, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Socola Mật Ong', 'Socola Mật Ong', 'Coated in premium Australian honey before being roasted to perfection, our Honey Roasted Macadamias have a delicious crisp candy-like shell that makes them incredibly moreish.\r\n\r\n', 'HONEY ROASTED MACADAMIAS', '', 'Coated in premium Australian honey before being roasted to perfection, our Honey Roasted Macadamias have a delicious crisp candy-like shell that makes them incredibly moreish.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'san-pham', ''),
(1143, 147, 'baiviet', 'man', 'Macca Socola Đen', 'Macca Socola Đen', 'Our Milk Chocolate Macadamias are the ultimate indulgence. Our nuts are drizzled in Belgian milk chocolate until a perfectly even coating is achieved. Topped off with a gloss finish, these really are bite-size pieces of heaven.\r\n\r\n', 'Dark Chocolate Macca', '', 'Our Milk Chocolate Macadamias are the ultimate indulgence. Our nuts are drizzled in Belgian milk chocolate until a perfectly even coating is achieved. Topped off with a gloss finish, these really are bite-size pieces of heaven.\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', 'san-pham', ''),
